{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1081853","title":"Microbial community of freshwater crustacean when fed with wastewater algal consortium","description":"The goal of this study was to test the potential of feeding small freshwater crustaceans with algal consortium from wastewater. Freshwater crustaceans are the prey of fish in the natural environment, so they can potentially be an important gradient as sustainable fish feed to fulfill the increasing demand for aquacultural products. This project was to understand what types of algae were consumed by crustaceans in a lab condition using microbial community analysis.","center":"Auburn University","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2024/02/28 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN40189307","MIMARKS Survey related sample from freshwater metagenome","non_environmental",null,"2023-08-14",2023,"US","Alabama",4830796,"Auburn","verified",32.55,-85.45,"USA: Alabama, Auburn",null,"Aquatic biome [ENVO:00002030]","Aerobic bioreactor [ENVO:00002126]","Freshwater Lake [ENVO 00000021]","laboratory or culture material"],["SAMN40189308","MIMARKS Survey related sample from freshwater metagenome","non_environmental",null,"2023-08-14",2023,"US","Alabama",4830796,"Auburn","verified",32.55,-85.45,"USA: Alabama, Auburn",null,"Aquatic biome [ENVO:00002030]","Aerobic bioreactor [ENVO:00002126]","Freshwater Lake [ENVO 00000021]","laboratory or culture material"],["SAMN40189309","MIMARKS Survey related sample from freshwater metagenome","non_environmental",null,"2023-08-14",2023,"US","Alabama",4830796,"Auburn","verified",32.55,-85.45,"USA: Alabama, Auburn",null,"Aquatic biome [ENVO:00002030]","Aerobic bioreactor [ENVO:00002126]","Freshwater Lake [ENVO 00000021]","laboratory or culture m